### 6. Commands to Push From Your Raspberry Pi to GitHub

1. **Create an empty repository on GitHub:** Go to [github.com/new](https://github.com/new), name it `jb-audio-visualizer`, leave **Initialize this repository with a README** unchecked, and click **Create repository**.
2. **Assemble your project folder on the Pi:**
   ```bash
   mkdir -p ~/jb-audio-visualizer/systemd
   cp ~/visualizer.py ~/wifi_portal.py ~/5x8.bdf ~/jb-audio-visualizer/
   cd ~/jb-audio-visualizer
